                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "87094d1c-9ba7-3cb7-8f05-2c9f4a7df777",
                                        "entry_id": "4209306c-f5ea-3566-a0f2-85e245ac35a3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Consisting of or involving a single element or component."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4254e512-9181-4a87-ab25-f920db415a53",
                                                "sense_id": "87094d1c-9ba7-3cb7-8f05-2c9f4a7df777",
                                                "text": "Her work is a renunciation of the old narrative, a throwing away of the cotton reel, an enunciation of the unary signifier, fort, that is meaningless in itself."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1d927589-8103-3439-8f09-5ac092e67348",
                                        "entry_id": "4209306c-f5ea-3566-a0f2-85e245ac35a3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of an operation, function, procedure, or logic gate, taking exactly one operand, argument, parameter, or input; having domain of dimension 1."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "353cc571-cef4-44ff-81e2-dc8d26228a15",
                                                "sense_id": "1d927589-8103-3439-8f09-5ac092e67348",
                                                "text": "Negation is a unary operation."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "36fc39ce-444e-48c3-91f8-84f963a60626",
                                                "sense_id": "1d927589-8103-3439-8f09-5ac092e67348",
                                                "text": "Zadeh’s claim is that if the meaning of an expression (X) can be modeling by a fuzzy membership function variable, then the meaning of an expression such as “very X” is simply a membership function over the same variable determined by applying a unary operator to the membership function for X."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9ca01954-fe0f-40ca-862a-277991f16f0b",
                                                "sense_id": "1d927589-8103-3439-8f09-5ac092e67348",
                                                "text": "On the other hand, blank spaces should not be used for unary operators such as unary minus (−), address of (&), indirection (*), member access (.), increment (++), and decrement (−−)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
